    <div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="My brother who lives in Seoul is visiting; the clause identifies one brother from three." data-hint="The speaker has three brothers, so the Seoul clue selects the intended one." data-fix="My brother who lives in Seoul is visiting."><p class="quiz-question">1. The speaker has three brothers, and only one lives in Seoul. Which sentence reports that identifying meaning?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="My brother who lives in Seoul is visiting; the clause identifies one brother from three.">My brother who lives in Seoul is visiting; the clause identifies one brother from three.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="My brother, who lives in Seoul, is visiting; the commas establish that all three brothers are one person.">My brother, who lives in Seoul, is visiting; the commas establish that all three brothers are one person.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="My brother that, lives in Seoul is visiting; that becomes parenthetical after one comma.">My brother that, lives in Seoul is visiting; that becomes parenthetical after one comma.</button></div></div>
