    <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>Dana Ruiz, <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="whom the board appointed in April" data-hint="The board is the subject of appointed; Dana is its object, and the exercise requests the formal object form." data-fix="Dana Ruiz, whom the board appointed in April, is the library director." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>, is the library director.</span></div>
