    <div class="q"><span class="n">5</span><span>After removing the opening-date comment, the complete main frame is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="The library is being renovated" data-hint="Join the subject The library directly to its main predicate is being renovated." data-fix="The library is being renovated." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>.</span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">6</span><span>All members of the already selected adviser group attended, so preserve the parenthetical set meaning: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="The selected advisers, all of whom attended both sessions, supported the plan" data-hint="Pair commas around all of whom and keep the selected group intact." data-fix="The selected advisers, all of whom attended both sessions, supported the plan." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>.</span></div>
