    <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span><span class="contraction">Tutor line 2:</span> <span class="ex">The selected consultants | who ALL speak Spanish | will lead the SESSIONS.</span> The parenthetical thought group describes <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="all of the already selected consultants" data-hint="Selected identifies the group before the inserted all comment." data-fix="All of the already selected consultants speak Spanish." data-placeholder="listen">listen</button>.</span></div>
