    <div class="q"><span class="n">5</span><span><span class="contraction">Tutor line 5:</span> <span class="ex">Dana Ruiz | who I SPOKE with yesterday | will attend.</span> Recover the conversational phrase: <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="who I spoke with" data-hint="Conversational who is followed by the subject I, and with remains at the end." data-fix="The conversational phrase is who I spoke with." data-placeholder="listen">listen</button>.</span></div>
