  <h2>Say the layers before you reveal them</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-transform>
    <h3>Guided oral reformulation</h3>
    <p>Read the exact context, produce one complete sentence aloud, and reveal only after you answer.</p>
    <div class="transform-list">
